---
// No dynamic data needed for this page — it's a static landing page.
// Update the two constants below with your real Calendly and Formspree details.
const CALENDLY_URL = "https://calendly.com/YOUR-CALENDLY-USERNAME/30min";
const FORMSPREE_ID = "YOUR_FORMSPREE_ID"; // from https://formspree.io — looks like "xyzabcde"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Borna Rodin — Tennis Placement Director</title>
<meta name="description" content="Independent placement director connecting junior tennis talent to verified European academies — without agency risk.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Borna Rodin — Tennis Placement Director">
<meta property="og:description" content="Independent placement director connecting junior tennis talent to verified European academies — without agency risk.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.css" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;background:#FAFAF8;overflow-x:hidden}

nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(11,22,40,0.88);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);padding:0 48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:62px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(200,95,46,0.2)}
.nav-logo{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#E8E2D5}
.nav-logo span{color:#C85F2E}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:32px;list-style:none}
.nav-links a{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.6);text-decoration:none;transition:color 0.2s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#E8E2D5}
.nav-cta{color:#C85F2E !important;opacity:1}

/* HERO */
.hero{position:relative;height:100vh;min-height:640px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;overflow:hidden}
.hero-video{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#080e1a}
.hero-video video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.hero-gradient{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(105deg, rgba(8,14,26,0.92) 0%, rgba(8,14,26,0.75) 50%, rgba(8,14,26,0.2) 100%)}
.hero-gradient::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:180px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(8,14,26,0.6))}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:0 56px 88px;max-width:700px}
.eyebrow{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C85F2E;margin-bottom:18px}
.hero-name{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(72px,11vw,118px);line-height:0.87;letter-spacing:0.025em;color:#E8E2D5;margin-bottom:22px}
.hero-name span{color:#C85F2E}
.hero-subtitle{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,22px);font-style:italic;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.68);margin-bottom:48px;max-width:480px;line-height:1.55}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:48px;margin-bottom:52px;padding-bottom:40px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(232,226,213,0.1)}
.stat-val{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:46px;color:#E8E2D5;line-height:1}
.stat-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.4);margin-top:5px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#C85F2E;color:#FAFAF8;padding:15px 40px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;border:none;transition:background 0.2s}
.btn:hover{background:#a84a22}
.btn-outline{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(232,226,213,0.3);color:#E8E2D5;margin-left:16px}
.btn-outline:hover{background:rgba(232,226,213,0.08)}

/* scroll indicator */
.scroll-hint{position:absolute;bottom:32px;right:56px;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.scroll-hint span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.3);writing-mode:vertical-rl}
.scroll-line{width:1px;height:48px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(200,95,46,0.6),transparent);animation:scrollpulse 2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes scrollpulse{0%,100%{opacity:0.4;transform:scaleY(1)}50%{opacity:1;transform:scaleY(1.1)}}

/* PROBLEM */
.problem{background:#0C1A2E;padding:96px 56px}
.section-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C85F2E;margin-bottom:14px}
.problem h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,48px);font-weight:600;color:#E8E2D5;line-height:1.15;max-width:600px;margin-bottom:64px}
.tiers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px}
.tier{padding:40px 36px}
.tier-bad{background:rgba(232,226,213,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(232,226,213,0.07)}
.tier-good{background:rgba(200,95,46,0.09);border:1px solid rgba(200,95,46,0.22)}
.tier-pill{display:inline-block;font-size:9px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 12px;margin-bottom:18px}
.tier-bad .tier-pill{background:rgba(232,226,213,0.07);color:rgba(232,226,213,0.35)}
.tier-good .tier-pill{background:rgba(200,95,46,0.2);color:#C85F2E}
.tier-name{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:14px}
.tier-bad .tier-name{color:rgba(232,226,213,0.45)}
.tier-good .tier-name{color:#E8E2D5}
.tier-desc{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.72;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.5)}
.tier-good .tier-desc{color:rgba(232,226,213,0.68)}
.problem-visual{margin-top:64px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;height:360px}
.problem-visual img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 65%}
.problem-visual-caption{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;padding:28px 36px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(8,14,26,0.88))}
.problem-visual-caption p{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:16px;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.65)}

/* HOW */
.how{background:#FAFAF8;padding:96px 56px}
.how-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:56px}
.how h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3.5vw,44px);font-weight:600;color:#0B1628;line-height:1.18}
.how-intro{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#5a5a5a}
.how-img-band{overflow:hidden;height:300px;margin-bottom:2px}
.how-img-band img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 38%}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0}
.step{padding:36px 32px;border-top:2px solid #C85F2E;background:#fff}
.step:not(:last-child){border-right:0.5px solid #ede8e0}
.step-num{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:60px;color:rgba(11,22,40,0.06);line-height:1;margin-bottom:14px}
.step-title{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#0B1628;margin-bottom:11px}
.step-body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.72;color:#686868}

/* JUNIOR SPLIT */
.junior{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:560px}
.junior-img{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.junior-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top}
.junior-panel{background:#0B1628;padding:80px 60px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.junior-panel h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(38px,4.5vw,60px);letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#E8E2D5;line-height:0.95;margin-bottom:26px}
.junior-panel h2 span{color:#C85F2E}
.junior-panel p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.58);margin-bottom:36px}
.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:44px}
.metric{border-top:1px solid rgba(200,95,46,0.28);padding-top:16px}
.metric-val{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:38px;color:#C85F2E;line-height:1}
.metric-label{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:0.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.38);margin-top:5px}

/* TRACK RECORD */
.creds{background:#E4DDD0;padding:96px 56px}
.creds h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,70px);letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#0B1628;line-height:0.95;margin-bottom:60px}
.creds h2 span{color:#C85F2E}
.cred-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:2px}
.cred-card{background:#FAFAF8;padding:30px 34px}
.cred-source{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C85F2E;margin-bottom:13px}
.cred-text{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#2a2a2a}

/* ABOUT */
.about{background:#080e1a;padding:96px 56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}
.about-img-wrap{position:relative}
.about-img-wrap img{width:100%;display:block}
.about-img-accent{position:absolute;bottom:-12px;right:-12px;width:60px;height:60px;border:2px solid #C85F2E}
.about-name{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:54px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#E8E2D5;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px}
.about-role{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:15px;font-style:italic;color:#C85F2E;margin-bottom:30px;letter-spacing:0.04em}
.about p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.82;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.58);margin-bottom:16px}
.highlights{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px}
.hl{display:flex;gap:13px;font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.72);line-height:1.55}
.hl-dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#C85F2E;margin-top:8px;flex-shrink:0}

/* CTA CLOSER */
.closer{position:relative;padding:96px 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}
.closer img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%}
.closer-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(8,14,26,0.86)}
.closer-content{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:0 20px;max-width:640px;width:100%}
.closer h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(44px,8vw,88px);letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#E8E2D5;line-height:0.95;margin-bottom:18px}
.closer-sub{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:20px;font-style:italic;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.65);margin-bottom:36px}
.btn-warm{display:inline-block;background:#E8E2D5;color:#0B1628;padding:16px 46px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;transition:background 0.2s;border:none;cursor:pointer}
.btn-warm:hover{background:#fff}
.closer-email{margin-top:18px;font-size:12px;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.4);letter-spacing:0.08em}
.closer-email a{color:rgba(232,226,213,0.6);text-decoration:underline}

/* CONTACT FORM */
.contact-divider{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin:40px 0;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.3);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase}
.contact-divider::before,.contact-divider::after{content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:rgba(232,226,213,0.15)}
.contact-form{text-align:left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.contact-form input,.contact-form textarea{width:100%;background:rgba(232,226,213,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(232,226,213,0.2);color:#E8E2D5;padding:13px 16px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:13px;border-radius:2px}
.contact-form input::placeholder,.contact-form textarea::placeholder{color:rgba(232,226,213,0.4)}
.contact-form input:focus,.contact-form textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:#C85F2E;background:rgba(232,226,213,0.1)}
.contact-form textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:90px}
.contact-form .btn{align-self:flex-start;margin-top:4px}
.form-note{font-size:11px;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.35);margin-top:4px}
@media (max-width:640px){.form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

footer{background:#050b14;padding:22px 56px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid rgba(200,95,46,0.12);flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.footer-logo{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.3)}
.footer-copy{font-size:11px;color:rgba(232,226,213,0.22);letter-spacing:0.05em}

@media (max-width:900px){
  .about{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .junior{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .tiers{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .cred-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  nav{padding:0 20px}
  .nav-links{gap:16px}
  .hero-content{padding:0 24px 60px}
  .problem,.how,.creds,.about{padding:64px 24px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">RODIN<span>.</span>SPORT</div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#problem">The Problem</a></li>
    <li><a href="#how">Methodology</a></li>
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Book a Call</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-video">
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto">
      <source src="/assets/hero-video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-gradient"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="eyebrow">Elite Tennis Placement &amp; Scouting — Croatia / Western Europe</div>
    <h1 class="hero-name">BORNA<br>RODIN<span>.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Independent placement director connecting junior tennis talent to verified European academies — without agency risk.</p>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div><div class="stat-val">40+</div><div class="stat-label">Academy partnerships</div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-val">7</div><div class="stat-label">Deals closed this year</div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-val">€250K+</div><div class="stat-label">Scholarship value</div></div>
    </div>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn">Schedule a Consultation →</a>
    <a href="#problem" class="btn btn-outline">Learn More</a>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">
    <div class="scroll-line"></div>
    <span>Scroll</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="problem" id="problem">
  <div class="section-label">The Industry Problem</div>
  <h2>Most families spend €75,000/year to end up in the wrong tier.</h2>
  <div class="tiers">
    <div class="tier tier-bad">
      <span class="tier-pill">Where 95% of clients land</span>
      <div class="tier-name">The Commercial Tier</div>
      <p class="tier-desc">High player-to-coach ratios. Rotating instructors. Back court allocation. Mega-academies market a luxury illusion — operationally, your child is revenue, not a development priority.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tier tier-good">
      <span class="tier-pill">What we contractually secure</span>
      <div class="tier-name">The Pro / Development Tier</div>
      <p class="tier-desc">Designated head coaches. Primary court allocation. Structured progression tracking with accountability milestones. This is what the top 5% access — and what we embed you into.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="problem-visual">
    <img src="/assets/image-1.jpg" alt="Clay court with racket and ball">
    <div class="problem-visual-caption"><p>The court does not lie. Neither do placement records.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how" id="how">
  <div class="how-top">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">Methodology</div>
      <h2>A placement process built to de-risk your family's capital.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="how-intro">We eliminate marketing bias by evaluating academies on systemic training outputs — not brand prestige. Every placement is matched to the player's technical style, developmental ceiling, and target trajectory.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="how-img-band">
    <img src="/assets/image-2.jpg" alt="Precision racket grip">
  </div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">01</div>
      <div class="step-title">Video Audit & Player Profile</div>
      <p class="step-body">Technical analysis of playing style, physical profile, and developmental ceiling. We match these to academy output profiles — not their marketing materials.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">02</div>
      <div class="step-title">Cluster Matching</div>
      <p class="step-body">Spain for clay-court physicality. France/Germany for technical precision. Czech Republic for competitive intensity. Matched by developmental output, not geography.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">03</div>
      <div class="step-title">Contractual Placement & Monitoring</div>
      <p class="step-body">Director-to-director relationships. Terms negotiated for Pro Tier entry. A €500/month monitoring retainer verifies the commitment is maintained after day one.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="junior">
  <div class="junior-img">
    <img src="/assets/image-3.jpg" alt="Junior tennis player">
  </div>
  <div class="junior-panel">
    <h2>YOUR CHILD'S<br><span>POTENTIAL</span><br>IS THE ASSET.</h2>
    <p>We serve high-net-worth families whose children compete at national and international junior level. Our clients are entrepreneurs, elite professionals, and ex-athletes who understand that the right system — not the most expensive brochure — determines outcomes.</p>
    <div class="metrics">
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-val">€3–8K</div><div class="metric-label">One-time placement fee</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-val">€500</div><div class="metric-label">Monthly monitoring</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-val">15–25</div><div class="metric-label">Placements per year</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-val">0</div><div class="metric-label">Hidden academy margins</div></div>
    </div>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn">Book a Free Assessment →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="creds" id="credentials">
  <div class="section-label">Track Record</div>
  <h2>BUILT ON<br><span>RESULTS.</span></h2>
  <div class="cred-grid">
    <div class="cred-card">
      <div class="cred-source">Zubo.hr — Brand Management &amp; Sales Director</div>
      <p class="cred-text">Built a healthcare coordination platform from zero to 20,000 monthly users. Established partnerships with 40+ clinics, 11 hotels, and major advertisers across Croatia.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cred-card">
      <div class="cred-source">Motorsport — Strategic Planning (Under NDA)</div>
      <p class="cred-text">VIP experience design and partner integration for F1 and Red Bull. Sponsor positioning and brand alignment at Monaco Grand Prix level.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cred-card">
      <div class="cred-source">Podravka d.d. — Business &amp; Data Analyst</div>
      <p class="cred-text">Governance and subcontractor management for a 6,000-employee organisation. Cross-functional stakeholder projects with Atos across 2 sectors and 50 cooperants.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cred-card">
      <div class="cred-source">Education</div>
      <p class="cred-text">MSc Sport Management in Marketing, University of Ljubljana. BA Economics &amp; Finance, Zagreb School of Economics. C2 English · B2 German &amp; Spanish.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-img-wrap">
    <img src="/assets/image-4.jpg" alt="Court line — precision">
    <div class="about-img-accent"></div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="about-name">BORNA RODIN</div>
    <div class="about-role">Managing Director — Commercial Partnerships &amp; Scouting</div>
    <p>I am not a tennis coach. I am the business system that protects your investment. My background is commercial negotiation, stakeholder management, and designing scalable partnership structures for sports organisations.</p>
    <p>The Managing Director manages risk and capital. The Head of Scouting manages technical relationships and video audits. Two roles. One aligned incentive: your child placed in the tier that matches their potential.</p>
    <div class="highlights">
      <div class="hl"><div class="hl-dot"></div><span>Closed 7 commercial deals this year across sports, healthcare, and corporate sectors</span></div>
      <div class="hl"><div class="hl-dot"></div><span>Direct relationships with 40+ academies across Spain, France, Germany, Czech Republic</span></div>
      <div class="hl"><div class="hl-dot"></div><span>Selective by design — reputation depends on outcomes, not volume</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="closer" id="contact">
  <img src="/assets/image-5.jpg" alt="Tennis success">
  <div class="closer-overlay"></div>
  <div class="closer-content">
    <h2>YOUR CHILD'S<br>NEXT MOVE<br>STARTS HERE.</h2>
    <p class="closer-sub">A 30-minute call to assess fit. No commitment. No agency pitch.</p>

    <button type="button" class="btn-warm" onclick={`Calendly.initPopupWidget({url: '${CALENDLY_URL}'}); return false;`}>Book a Free Assessment →</button>
    <p class="closer-email">or email <a href={`mailto:borna.rodin@gmail.com`}>borna.rodin@gmail.com</a></p>

    <div class="contact-divider">or send an inquiry directly</div>

    <form class="contact-form" action={`https://formspree.io/f/${FORMSPREE_ID}`} method="POST">
      <div class="form-row">
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Parent / guardian name" required>
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email address" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)">
        <input type="text" name="player_age" placeholder="Player's age / ranking (optional)">
